         ("The word 'clamor' in the final sentence is closest in meaning to:", ["uproar", "coolness", "moisture", "wealth"], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "C1", "'Clamor' berarti suara gaduh/kebisingan ramai."),
         ("Which city and origin figure directly in the birth of Guastavino's career shift?", ["Bringing Catalan traditional vaulting craft to New York in 1881.", "Inventing heavy steel I-beams across medieval Parisian bridges.", "Mining red sandstone domes inside western desert canyons.", "Importing concrete railway arches from Tokyo shipyards."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B1", "Ia membawa teknik tradisional Catalonia ke New York tahun 1881."),
         ("Which advantage is NOT attributed to Guastavino's system in the passage?", ["Generating hydro-electric power from dome roof drains.", "Fire resistance compared to wooden framing.", "Reduced structural roof weight.", "Acoustic sound absorption using porous tiles."], 0, "ITP-MOD-10", "B2", "Tenaga hidroelektrik tidak pernah disebut."),
