     "Modern acousticians quantify such irregular textures precisely with mathematical Quadratic Residue Diffusers (QRDs): calculated rows of varying-depth wooden wells tuned so high-frequency treble scatters uniformly across every audience seat without absorbing natural orchestral energy like heavy foam carpets.",
