         ("Why are large concave walls hazardous inside un-treated musical halls?", ["Curved surfaces concentrate reflected sound into jarring loud spots while starving corners.", "Concave plaster cracks swiftly under loud trombone notes.", "Curved walls absorb low bass cello tones permanently.", "Sound speeds double linearly near arched ceilings."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B2", "Dinding cekung memusatkan pantulan sehingga memunculkan hotspot keras dan area bayangan senyap."),
         ("What beneficial physical role did elaborate nineteenth-century plaster carvings perform by accident?", ["Scattering sound energy smoothly instead of creating sharp echo slap.", "Preventing outside subway trains from shaking stone piers.", "Drying winter audience dampness swiftly off wood benches.", "Blocking bright sunlight behind orchestra conductors."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B2", "Ornamen kolom berlekuk menyebar gelombang suara secara acak (difusi)."),
